{
  "chapter": "ch2",
  "title": "The Creator and Creation",
  "base_url": "https://www.lawofone.info/s/",
  "provenance": [
    {
      "section_id": "ch2-creator-nature",
      "section_title": "The Nature of the Creator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [1],
          "sources": ["13.5", "27.5", "51.10", "18.13"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/51#10",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/18#13"
          ],
          "note": "Creator is not apart from creation; infinity is creation; unity is all that there is"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [2],
          "sources": ["13.6", "13.7", "15.21"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#6",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/15#21"
          ],
          "note": "Bridge from the how to the who; recalls infinity aware, focus, Love, Light"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [3],
          "sources": ["30.5"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/30#5"],
          "note": "One Infinite Creator present in its entirety in the simplest iota of a complex"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [4],
          "sources": ["51.10", "27.7", "28.1", "13.13"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/51#10",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/28#1",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#13"
          ],
          "note": "Two natures of the Creator (unpotentiated/potentiated); unity cannot be specified by physics; mystery"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [5],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Editorial philosophical parallel (Spinoza); no Ra anchor"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [6, 7],
          "sources": ["82.10"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#10"],
          "note": "The Creator does not properly create as much as It experiences Itself; each generation of knowing begets a knowing with capacity to choose methods"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [8],
          "sources": ["21.9", "50.7", "82.29", "82.12"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/21#9",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/50#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#29",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#12"
          ],
          "note": "The forgetting belongs to third density, the only plane of forgetting; the veil was introduced by the Logoi; no veil at the beginning of this octave; without forgetting the choice would carry no weight"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [9],
          "sources": ["82.10", "13.13"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#10", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#13"],
          "note": "Plenum full of the glory and power of the Creator; any portion contains the One Creator holographically"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [10],
          "sources": ["10.14"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/10#14"],
          "note": "Seeking as recognition; closest Ra text is the exercises 'see the Creator'"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "ch2-consciousness",
      "section_title": "Consciousness as the Foundation of All",
      "segments": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [1],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Editorial contrast with materialist assumption"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [2],
          "sources": ["1.0", "13.6", "13.7", "82.12"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/1#0",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#6",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#12"
          ],
          "note": "You are part of a thought; infinity became aware; creation itself is a form of unified consciousness"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [3],
          "sources": ["82.12", "30.5"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#12", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/30#5"],
          "note": "Logos as the great heart of creation; much manifested without consciousness as usually understood; Creator present in first density"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [4],
          "sources": ["30.5", "13.17", "16.21"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/30#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#17",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/16#21"
          ],
          "note": "Consciousness through densities; spirit complex existed potentially from the beginning of space/time"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [5],
          "sources": ["30.2"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/30#2"],
          "note": "Tree and roots of mind: intuition, racial memory, cosmic influxes, spirit complex as channel"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [6],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Editorial philosophical parallels (idealism, panpsychism)"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [7],
          "sources": ["30.2", "13.9", "27.16"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/30#2",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#9",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#16"
          ],
          "note": "Mind, body, spirit inextricably intertwined; spirit complex as channel to intelligent infinity; matter forms from Light"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [8],
          "sources": ["13.5", "27.5"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#5", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#5"],
          "note": "The perceiver and the perceived are the one Creator; the infinity is creation; unity is all that there is"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [9],
          "sources": ["13.13", "51.10"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#13", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/51#10"],
          "note": "Each entity as a focus of the Creator; implications for self-understanding"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "ch2-original-thought",
      "section_title": "The Original Thought",
      "segments": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [1],
          "sources": ["1.0"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/1#0"],
          "note": "All things are part of one Original Thought"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [2],
          "sources": ["1.0", "82.10"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/1#0", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#10"],
          "note": "Gloss on what 'thought' means at the level of the Original Thought; Ra defines it as the harvest of all previous experience of the Creator"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [3],
          "sources": ["13.7", "27.12", "27.13"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#12",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#13"
          ],
          "note": "Awareness led to focus of infinity; Logos or Love; great activator and primal co-Creator; energy of extremely high order"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [4],
          "sources": ["27.12"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#12"],
          "note": "Love as the focus, choice of attack; worshiped as the Creator instead of unity"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [5],
          "sources": ["15.21", "54.27", "27.10"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/15#21",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#27",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#10"
          ],
          "note": "Free Will finds focus (Love); Love creates Light; origin of all energy is Free Will acting upon Love"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [6],
          "sources": ["27.6", "13.8"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#6", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#8"],
          "note": "Rhythm of reality: focusing outward then inward until coalesced; patterns appear holographically"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [7],
          "sources": ["13.8", "13.13", "82.9"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#8",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#13",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#9"
          ],
          "note": "Holographic patterns; universes and galaxies; Original Thought partaken in a gradient (82.9)"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [8],
          "sources": ["1.0"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/1#0"],
          "note": "What thoughts were part of the Original Thought today; dancing thoughts"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [9],
          "sources": ["54.8"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#8"],
          "note": "Harmony with the Original Thought is fluid and plastic, not systematic; balanced blending of energy centers with minimal distortion"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "ch2-free-will-depth",
      "section_title": "Free Will as Fundamental Law",
      "segments": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [1],
          "sources": ["15.21", "27.10", "54.27"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/15#21",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#10",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#27"
          ],
          "note": "Free Will as First Distortion; sequence Free Will, Love, Light"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [2],
          "sources": ["27.8", "27.9"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#8", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#9"],
          "note": "In this distortion the Creator will know Itself; total freedom of choice in the ways of knowing (Ra affirms 'quite correct')"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [3],
          "sources": ["27.9", "54.7"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#9", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#7"],
          "note": "Every path permitted; variety as hallmark of the infinite Creator"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [4],
          "sources": ["13.12", "54.7"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#12", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#7"],
          "note": "Finity discerned through freedom of awareness; without potentials for misunderstanding there would be no experience"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [5],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Forward reference to a later chapter"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [6],
          "sources": ["3.14", "21.9", "54.7"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/3#14",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/21#9",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#7"
          ],
          "note": "Law of Confusion equals Law of Free Will; forgetting needed for confusion to operate; no experience without potentials for misunderstanding"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [7],
          "sources": ["21.9", "50.7", "82.18"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/21#9",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/50#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#18"
          ],
          "note": "The veil preserves the weight of choice; pre-veil third density was pallid"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [8],
          "sources": ["34.6", "21.9", "50.7", "82.29"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/34#6",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/21#9",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/50#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#29"
          ],
          "note": "Pain as potential for learning; confusion as free will in the plane of forgetting; veil introduced by the Logoi"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [9],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Forward reference to a later chapter"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [10],
          "sources": ["16.21"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/16#21"],
          "note": "Circle of being; densities as cycles: awareness, growth, self-awareness, love, wisdom, unity, gateway"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "ch2-co-creator",
      "section_title": "Each Entity as Co-Creator",
      "segments": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [1],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Bridge from cosmology to the individual"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [2],
          "sources": ["13.13", "13.15"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#13", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#15"],
          "note": "Galaxy and all material things are products of individualized portions of intelligent infinity; each became co-Creator; natural laws; process from larger to smaller"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [3],
          "sources": ["13.13", "13.15", "30.5", "54.5", "51.10"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#13",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#15",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/30#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/51#10"
          ],
          "note": "Process continues down to the mind/body/spirit complex (sub-sub-Logos); co-Creators potentiated by Free Will; any portion contains the One Creator holographically"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [4],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Editorial philosophical parallel (Upanishads)"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [5],
          "sources": ["30.5", "42.2", "41.25", "51.10", "54.5"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/30#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/42#2",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/41#25",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/51#10",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#5"
          ],
          "note": "Every mind/body/spirit complex is a co-Creator (51.10, 54.5); spirit complex potential from the beginning, activated on awareness of service (30.5); the balanced entity co-creates experiential occurrences (41.25, 42.2)"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [6],
          "sources": ["51.10", "54.5", "13.13"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/51#10",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#13"
          ],
          "note": "Free Will has potentiated us as co-Creators; sub-sub-Logos; holographic presence of the Creator"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [7],
          "sources": ["52.7", "42.2"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/52#7", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/42#2"],
          "note": "Will as the faculty powerful in you as co-Creator; co-creating experience follows balance"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [8],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Editorial conclusion; no direct Ra anchor"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "ch2-purpose",
      "section_title": "The Purpose of Creation",
      "segments": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [1],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Framing question; not a Ra statement"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [2],
          "sources": ["82.10", "78.10"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#10", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/78#10"],
          "note": "The One Original Thought is the harvest of all previous experience of the Creator by the Creator; plenum"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [3],
          "sources": ["82.10", "54.7"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#10", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#7"],
          "note": "Knowing begets knowing; portions partake less purely for the refinement of the One Original Thought; variety is the hallmark of the infinite Creator"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [4],
          "sources": ["82.10", "21.9", "50.7"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#10",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/21#9",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/50#7"
          ],
          "note": "The Creator experiences Itself rather than creating; forgetting necessary"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [5],
          "sources": ["50.7", "82.18", "82.22", "54.7"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/50#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#18",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#22",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#7"
          ],
          "note": "Forgetting gives weight to the game; pre-veil experience pallid; no experience without potentials for misunderstanding"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [6],
          "sources": ["30.5", "13.16", "13.17", "82.12"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/30#5",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#16",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#17",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#12"
          ],
          "note": "Densities as progression of awareness toward a more comprehensive beingness; the densities as an efficient way of creating conditions for self-conscious beings"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [7],
          "sources": ["21.9", "50.7"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/21#9", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/50#7"],
          "note": "The forgetting belongs to third density; the rest of the paragraph is the book's own image (infinite book), with no direct Ra anchor"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [8],
          "sources": ["13.12", "27.8", "54.7", "50.7"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/13#12",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/27#8",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/54#7",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/50#7"
          ],
          "note": "Infinity invested itself in many-ness; Creator will know Itself; the game requires forgetting"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [9],
          "sources": ["76.15", "76.16", "76.17"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/76#15",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/76#16",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/76#17"
          ],
          "note": "Third density is a choice; a uniquely short period; the work of a moment and the axis upon which the creation turns"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [10],
          "sources": ["76.16", "82.18"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/76#16", "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#18"],
          "note": "The prelude to choice lays the foundation; the remainder of the densities is continuous refining of the choice; pre-veil experience was pallid"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [11],
          "sources": ["10.14"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/10#14"],
          "note": "The moment contains love; the first attempt is the cornerstone; each seeking powers the previous"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [12],
          "sources": ["10.14"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/10#14"],
          "note": "Exercises Two, Three, Four: see the Creator in the other, in the mirror, in the creation"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [13],
          "sources": ["10.14"],
          "urls": ["https://www.lawofone.info/s/10#14"],
          "note": "Prerequisite is a predilection toward meditation, contemplation or prayer; data sinks into roots of mind"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [14],
          "sources": ["29.18", "40.1", "28.16", "82.10"],
          "urls": [
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/29#18",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/40#1",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/28#16",
            "https://www.lawofone.info/s/82#10"
          ],
          "note": "Spiritual mass and coalescence; return to intelligent infinity awaiting potentiation by Free Will outside time; infinite progression only assumed, clad in mystery; the One Original Thought as harvest of previous experience"
        },
        {
          "paragraphs": [15],
          "sources": [],
          "urls": [],
          "note": "Editorial conclusion; closest Ra text 27.6 and 16.21"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "ch2-bridge",
      "section_title": "Bridge Toward the Densities",
      "segments": [
        {
          "paragraphs": [1],
